Voting Unit (Unit A):
Included: All full-time and regular part-time road supervisors, dispatchers, schedulers, reservationists, customer service representatives, administrative assistants, payroll clerks, and parts clerks employed by the Employer at its Decatur, Illinois facilities;

Excluded: All professional employees, managers, and guards and supervisors, as defined in the Act.  

If a majority of valid ballots are cast for THE AMALGAMATED TRANSIT UNION LOCAL 859, they will be taken to have indicated the employees' desire to be included in the existing unit consisting of operating and maintenance employees, including mechanics, utility employees, custodian employees, drivers, and paratransit drivers, currently represented by the AMALGAMATED TRANSIT UNION LOCAL 859.  If a majority of valid ballots are not cast for representation, they will be taken to have indicated the employees' desire to remain unrepresented.
